WEBVTT

44:01.999 --> 44:04.835
Soon we'll have new recruits

44:04.960 --> 44:08.214
and you lot will be passed along
to the lord commander

44:08.339 --> 44:10.257
for assignment,

44:10.382 --> 44:14.887
and they will call you
men of the Night's Watch,

44:15.012 --> 44:16.639
but you'd be fools to believe it.

44:18.307 --> 44:20.184
You're boys still.

44:20.309 --> 44:23.938
And come the winter you will die...

44:25.397 --> 44:27.399
like flies.
